    "background_story": "Alvin had always been fascinated by the world of robotics. As a child, he spent hours building and programming his own robots, teaching himself the intricacies of coding and engineering. As he grew older, his passion only intensified, and he decided to apply for a prestigious robotics program at a top university. Despite facing stiff competition, Alvin's dedication and natural talent earned him a spot in the program. He threw himself into his studies, applying the theoretical concepts to real-world problems and collaborating with his peers on innovative projects. Alvin's hard work paid off when he was selected for a coveted internship at a leading tech firm, where he applied his skills to develop cutting-edge robotic solutions. His journey was a testament to the power of applying oneself to a dream and working tirelessly to bring it to life.",
